 a rundown top-floor unit in an old Hong Kong tenement at dusk, with an old bronze mirror, dim lamplight mixed with the last glow of sunset).\",\n  \"summary\": \"An 8-second frozen close-up on 沈嶼's face in a dim old tenement unit: staring toward 文文, his Adam's apple rolls before he asks, hoarse and trembling, if she is Man Man.\",\n  \"retention_analysis\": \"The locked close-up forces the viewer into his disbelief; the rolling throat and whispered Cantonese question land twenty years of grief in one breath.\",\n  \"detailed_description\": \"Duration 8 seconds. Realistic cinematic film quality, 16:9 widescreen, shot on 35mm film with visible grain, natural matte skin texture, no digital smoothing; dim dusk interior, still and heavy. Timeline: 0–3s — tight close-up on 沈嶼's face, frozen mid-breath, staring toward the right of frame where 文文 stands; his eyes wide with disbelief. 3–5s — his Adam's apple rolls visibly as he swallows; the room is almost silent. 5–8s — he speaks hoarsely, very softly, in a trembling Hong Kong Cantonese voice: \\\"你係……文文？\\\" The voice is light, carrying a tremor of utter disbelief. Static camera, no cuts, no shake.\",\n  \"overall_soundscape\": \"The room is almost completely silent — only the faintest room tone and his shallow breathing. Dialogue is spoken in Hong Kong Cantonese exactly as scripted: \\\"你係……文文？\\\" (S1), hoarse, soft, and trembling, with accurate lip sync. No other speech.\",\n  \"non_diegetic_music\": \"A single sparse piano note sounds, isolated and cold, with long silence around it. No split screen, no subtitles, no on-screen text, no logos, no watermarks.\"\n}"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [839.43798828125, 640.7214965820312], "pos": [-1687.28271484375, 4574.7431640625], "id": 2, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ve